<section class="areas py-5 pb-10" id="areas">
  <div class="max-w-[var(--container-kuarahy)] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-[900px]:grid-cols-1">
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="area-card reveal block bg-white dark:bg-panel border-pixel border-noche dark:border-crema shadow-pixel-xl p-9 px-8 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-150 hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 hover:shadow-pixel-xs"
      >
        <p class="font-display text-[13px] text-amanecer mb-3.5">01</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(1.2rem,2.6vw,1.7rem)] leading-[1.2] mb-3.5 uppercase">ESTUDIO DE<br>SOFTWARE</h2>
        <p class="opacity-85 mb-5">Proyectos a medida, llave en mano: webs, tiendas online y sistemas construidos para tu negocio.</p>
        <span class="font-display text-xs tracking-[1px] border-b-[3px] border-sol pb-[3px]">VER SERVICIOS ▸</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#productos"
        class="area-card reveal block bg-noche text-crema dark:bg-sol dark:text-noche border-pixel border-noche dark:border-noche shadow-pixel-xl p-9 px-8 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-150 hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 hover:shadow-pixel-xs"
      >
        <p class="font-display text-[13px] text-amanecer mb-3.5">02</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(1.2rem,2.6vw,1.7rem)] leading-[1.2] mb-3.5 uppercase">PRODUCTOS<br>SAAS</h2>
        <p class="opacity-85 mb-5">Nuestro software como servicio: pagás una suscripción y nosotros lo mantenemos funcionando por vos.</p>
        <span class="font-display text-xs tracking-[1px] border-b-[3px] border-sol pb-[3px]">VER PRODUCTOS ▸</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
